```css
@font-face {
  font-family: "Inter";
  src: url("/fonts/inter-var.woff2") format("woff2");  /* self-hosted */
  font-weight: 100 900;
  font-display: swap;          /* show fallback text immediately */
}

body {
  font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
}
```

| Piece | Job |
|---|---|
| stack order. | first available font wins. |
| generic last (`sans-serif`). | always-available safety net. |
| `font-display: swap`. | no invisible text while loading. |
| similar-metric fallback. | smaller jump when the font swaps. |
| self-hosting. | no third-party requests revealing visitors' IPs. |

